<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Celulosa 6-month loss.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Celulosa 6-month loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30.</p>
<p>Net loss $54.68 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>Net assets $88.54 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Pulp and paper company Celulosa Argentina SA said second quarter sales were $30.03 million, up 6.0 percent on the previous quarter.</p>
<p>Paper deliveries in the second quarter rose 13 percent from the first quarter and 19 percent from the same period the previous year. Pulp deliveries were down 6.0 percent on the first quarter but up 17 percent on the year-ago period.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0695))</p>
